      <title>Section 54 - Circulation Form of Green's Theorem</title>
      <objectives>
  <p><em>Learning Objectives</em></p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Apply the circulation form of Green's Theorem.
    </li>
    <li>
      Use Green's Theorem to calculate work.
    </li>
    <li>
      Use Green's Theorem to find the area of a region enclosed by a curve.
    </li>
  </ul>
</objectives>

